= <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> Executive Committee Meeting

Reginald Eikenvorst, recovering from surgery the past few months due to a resurgence of his health problems, has ultimately resigned in favor of his deputy Soren Coalfax, who is now guaranteed to succeed him as chairman.

Soren Coalfax is one of the first within the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> to support the movement for propertied unity and is popular with the youth and propertied unity groups that have coalesced on the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>'s left wing, having rallied around Snowell and his efforts last month. Coalfax is also sufficiently conservative on most political issues—particularly on the question of cooperation with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>—to gain support from the party's right wing.

- @resultsdvp: The party votes...

